<title>POLAND: Novita revises down 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>Novita revises down 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novita SA preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     7.11   vs    4.25</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 6.00   vs    2.71</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.80   vs    1.90</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Novita SA. Earlier, in its Q4 report the company showed a 1996 net of 4.03 million, a pre-tax of 6.21 million and an operating profit of 7.27 million.</p>
<p>    net sales			     67.59   vs   55.11</p>
<p>    costs of sales			50.21   vs   42.08</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.05   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.20   vs    0.82</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   4.25   vs    3.80</p>
<p>    financial costs			5.31   vs    5.30</p>
<p>    investment			     7.23   vs    7.96</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
